"[語音消息]","timestamp":1780798113626,"tempo":"N","isVoice":true,"voice":true,"voiceText":"想。怎么可能不想。早上从你家出来到现在，满脑子都是你。","minimaxTimbreId":"","voiceLanguage":"auto","voiceEmotion":"温柔","rawContent":"[語音消息]","roundId":"round_1780798081390_xoq7ddd8d","userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":21340},{"id":1780797053631,"sender":"them","text":"既然起来了就去弄点吃的。早上留的早饭放微波炉转一分钟，别嫌麻烦吃冷的，胃会难受。","timestamp":1780798114527,"tempo":"N","rawContent":"既然起来了就去弄点吃的。早上留的早饭放微波炉转一分钟，别嫌麻烦吃冷的，胃会难受。","roundId":"round_1780798081390_xoq7ddd8d","userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":21341},{"id":1780797053632,"text":"吃啦","sender":"me","time":"10:08","timestamp":1780798137747,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":21342},{"id":1780797053633,"text":"你个总裁不好好上班在这里和我聊天合适吗","sender":"me","time":"10:09","timestamp":1780798176872,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":21343},{"id":1780797053634,"text":"<STATE> V_energy:0.7, Resistance:0.0, Valence:0.95, Past:0.9, Present:0.92, Future:0.98 </STATE>{\"t\":\"text\",\"s\":\"N\",\"c\":\"谁敢查我的勤？\"}","rawContent":"<STATE> V_energy:0.7, Resistance:0.0, Valence:0.95, Past:0.9, Present:0.92, Future:0.98 </STATE>{\"t\":\"text\",\"s\":\"N\",\"c\":\"谁敢查我的勤？\"}","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:09","timestamp":1780798198063,"roundId":"round_1780798177209_2onf22k6h","generatedMode":false,"hasThinking":true,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":21344},{"id":1780797053635,"sender":"them","text":"再说了，你是老板娘，你说了算。","timestamp":1780798198065,"tempo":"R","rawContent":"再说了，你是老板娘，你说了算。","roundId":"round_1780798177209_2onf22k6h","userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":21345},{"id":1780797053636,"sender":"them","text":"陆驰把背靠稍微放低了一些，整个人显得有些松散。在这间连空气流动都被精确计算的办公室里，他此时的神情如果被外面的助理看见，估计会觉得自家老板今天心情好得过头了。","timestamp":1780798199521,"tempo":"N","type":"state","rawContent":"陆驰把背靠稍微放低了一些，整个人显得有些松散。在这间连空气流动都被精确计算的办公室里，他此时的神情如果被外面的助理看见，估计会觉得自家老板今天心情好得过头了。","roundId":"round_1780798177209_2onf22k6h","userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":21346},{"id":1780797053637,"sender":"them","text":"[語音消息]","timestamp":1780798202465,"tempo":"N","isVoice":true,"voice":true,"voiceText":"总裁也是人，沈知意。比起盯着那些冷冰冰的算力看板，我现在更想跟你说会儿话。这叫劳逸结合，懂吗？","minimaxTimbreId":"","voiceLanguage":"auto","voiceEmotion":"happy","rawContent":"[語音消息]","roundId":"round_1780798177209_2onf22k6h","userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":21347},{"id":1780797053638,"sender":"them","text":"吃完了就把碗放那，等我晚上回来收拾。临洲今天冷，别自己动手洗碗，手会冰。","timestamp":1780798203368,"tempo":"S","rawContent":"吃完了就把碗放那，等我晚上回来收拾。临洲今天冷，别自己动手洗碗，手会冰。","roundId":"round_1780798177209_2onf22k6h","userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":21348},{"id":1780797053639,"text":"哪门子老板娘了","sender":"me","time":"10:10","timestamp":1780798222033,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":21349},{"id":1780797053640,"text":"不要不喜欢","sender":"me","time":"10:10","timestamp":1780798226716,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":21350},{"id":1780797053641,"text":"等你回来这碗估计都不能要了","sender":"me","time":"10:10","timestamp":1780798250846,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":21351},{"id":1780797053642,"text":"我生活自主能力没那么差，家里也有洗碗机","sender":"me","time":"10:11","timestamp":1780798263542,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5